OL,3,GNEWSADrug dealer ordered to repay more
OL,4,Athan #250,000
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe ringleader of a "major drugs supply
OL,7,Fnetwork" has been ordered to pay back
OL,8,Fmore than #250,000 from the
OL,9,Fmultimillion-pound operation.
OL,11,FMohammed Tasadiq Khan, from Dewsbury,
OL,12,Fwas jailed for 16 years in August 2024
OL,13,Fafter pleading guilty to conspiracy to
OL,14,Fsupply cocaine and heroin and
OL,15,Fpossession criminal property in
OL,16,Frelation to a #100m drugs plot.
OL,18,FA confiscation hearing at Leeds Crown
OL,19,FCourt on Monday heard Khan's benefit
OL,20,Fhad been #2.75m.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
